-- One-time data migration (2026-11-05): the universities of the University Preparation page for production. No schema change.
--
-- Adds the eight universities shown on /universities (INHA, Narxoz, WIUT, MDIS, KIUT, MU, CAU, TUIT) to the ILMORA site settings, exactly as
-- packages/shared/src/university-packages.ts records them (`published: true`): official names, websites, logos, faculties,
-- directions and entrance subjects. Packages are NOT added: they stay drafts until verified and are published from the
-- Super Admin panel, so nothing new can be bought.
--
-- Append-only: a university whose id is already stored is left exactly as it is, nothing is removed or rewritten, and no
-- other site setting, user, subscription, payment, enrollment, course or group is touched.
-- Safety: the stored university list and version are written to "AuditEvent" (action 'content.sync', id
-- 'university-sync-20261105-SiteConfig') before the change; the step runs in its own sub-transaction, so a failure is
-- rolled back and reported without failing the migration. A database without the ILMORA catalog (tests, fresh installs)
-- is left untouched, and running it again adds nothing.
-- Undo: set "SiteConfig".data->'universities' back to the "before" list of that audit row.

